codex
Implemented in [usage-pulse](/srv/server-main/bin/usage-pulse:257).

- Claude scanning now uses recursive `rglob()` and attributes nested subagents to the top-level Claude project.
- Added incremental Codex rollout collection using `last_token_usage`, grouped by dash-encoded `cwd`.
- Preserved the existing `tokens`, history, and offsets formats; added only `codex_tokens`.
- Added per-source and per-file error isolation.

Live pulse result:

- Claude usage catch-up grew from `5,069,358` to `682,174,527` across input/output/cache fields.
- Registered 486 nested Claude offsets and 464 Codex offsets.
- Codex: 22 projects, `513,438,909` total tokens.

Example from [agents.jsonl](/srv/server-main/usage/agents.jsonl:105):

```json
"codex_tokens": {
  "-srv-blueprint": {"in":15849702,"out":214912,"total":16064614},
  "-srv-server-main": {"in":1693577,"out":67796,"total":1761373},
  "-srv-probot-business-harita-vault": {"in":225137847,"out":727749,"total":225890198}
}
```

Python compilation, offsets validation, dashboard parsing, and policy history parsing all passed. No Go changes or service restarts.
